She was one of the first
photojournalists into Dachau.

188
00:12:26.412 --> 00:12:29.457
- Do you know her stuff?
- Yeah. I know who Lee Miller is.

189
00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:30.625
Of course.

190
00:12:30.708 --> 00:12:35.463
But I want to say
that you're also one of my heroes.

191
00:12:35.546 --> 00:12:39.509
And you've got
the same name too. [chuckles]

192
00:12:39.592 --> 00:12:42.887
Well. thank you. I'm in good company.

193
00:12:45.515 --> 00:12:48.017
- What's your name?
- Jessie.

194
00:12:48.101 --> 00:12:49.227
Jessie Collin.

195
00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:53.606
So. Jessie. I've gotta walk up
ten flights of stairs.

196
00:12:54.816 --> 00:12:57.193
But. if I ever see you again.

197
00:12:57.277 --> 00:12:59.779
