213
00:15:37.687 --> 00:15:39.856
[Lee] She's a kid. did you notice that?

214
00:15:39.939 --> 00:15:42.900
[Joel] She's. like. 23.
and she wants to do what we do.

215
00:15:42.984 --> 00:15:44.694
She wants to do what you do.

216
00:15:46.487 --> 00:15:47.905
We had to start one day.

217
00:15:48.948 --> 00:15:50.700
Were you much older than she is now?

218
00:15:59.584 --> 00:16:03.045
Whatever happens.
she goes no further than Charlottesville.

219
00:16:10.553 --> 00:16:13.014
All right. Let's go.

220
00:16:13.097 --> 00:16:15.057
["Rocket USA" by Suicide plays]

221
00:16:15.141 --> 00:16:17.059
- [seat belt clicks]
- [engine starts]

222
00:16:29.363 --> 00:16:31.574
["Rocket USA" playing]

223
00:16:50.384 --> 00:16:52.011
You don't wanna miss this.

224
00:18:11.632 --> 00:18:14.302
Mr. President. do you regret
any actions implemented

225
00:18:14.385 --> 00:18:16.679
