236
00:18:49.253 --> 00:18:51.339
We got over half a tank.

237
00:18:51.422 --> 00:18:55.217
[birds chirping]

238
00:18:58.638 --> 00:18:59.847
What do you think?

239
00:19:02.933 --> 00:19:05.478
Any chance to refuel. we should take.

240
00:19:05.561 --> 00:19:06.604
Okay.

241
00:19:23.371 --> 00:19:24.288
