245
00:19:42.598 --> 00:19:45.976
No. we're...
We're actually just passing through.

246
00:19:47.937 --> 00:19:49.021
Can't help you. sorry.

247
00:19:50.564 --> 00:19:52.149
Sir. if we pay...

248
00:19:52.233 --> 00:19:54.443
